# claim-auditor reads no configuration, provider or credential settings from
# environment variables and loads no .env files. (The local git subprocess used for
# snapshots inherits the host environment with GIT_* variables removed.)
# No provider is enabled in the construction baseline.
# Future owner activation injects credentials in memory through LiveOwnerContext
# (cli.main(argv, owner_context=...)); there is deliberately no ENV/dotenv path
# for provider, model or credential selection. Keep this file free of names and values.
